{"text": "El hada vio que Pinocho empezaba a actuar con honestidad y cuidado. Con su magia lo convirtió en un niño. Pinocho volvió a la escuela, sabiendo que hacerse responsable de los errores requiere practicar cada día. Pinocho: Puedo equivocarme y también aprender a repararlo.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.360166, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.374916, "end": 0.552124, "from": 3, "to": 7}, {"start": 0.566875, "end": 0.817958, "from": 8, "to": 11}, {"start": 0.832708, "end": 0.995166, "from": 12, "to": 15}, {"start": 1.009958, "end": 1.482541, "from": 16, "to": 23}, {"start": 1.497291, "end": 2.161874, "from": 24, "to": 32}, {"start": 2.176666, "end": 2.206207, "from": 33, "to": 34}, {"start": 2.220958, "end": 2.604958, "from": 35, "to": 41}, {"start": 2.619708, "end": 2.826458, "from": 42, "to": 45}, {"start": 2.84125, "end": 3.505833, "from": 46, "to": 56}, {"start": 3.520583, "end": 3.594416, "from": 57, "to": 58}, {"start": 3.609208, "end": 4.229499, "from": 59, "to": 66}, {"start": 5.257541, "end": 5.479082, "from": 68, "to": 71}, {"start": 5.493875, "end": 5.641541, "from": 72, "to": 74}, {"start": 5.656291, "end": 6.069791, "from": 75, "to": 80}, {"start": 6.084583, "end": 6.217499, "from": 81, "to": 83}, {"start": 6.232291, "end": 6.837791, "from": 84, "to": 93}, {"start": 6.852541, "end": 6.970707, "from": 94, "to": 96}, {"start": 6.985458, "end": 7.133124, "from": 97, "to": 99}, {"start": 7.147916, "end": 7.590957, "from": 100, "to": 104}, {"start": 8.61, "end": 9.097375, "from": 106, "to": 113}, {"start": 9.112125, "end": 9.525625, "from": 114, "to": 120}, {"start": 9.540416, "end": 9.5847069, "from": 121, "to": 122}, {"start": 9.5995, "end": 9.688125, "from": 123, "to": 125}, {"start": 9.702875, "end": 10.234541, "from": 126, "to": 133}, {"start": 10.559416, "end": 11.120624, "from": 135, "to": 143}, {"start": 11.135416, "end": 11.268332, "from": 144, "to": 147}, {"start": 11.283083, "end": 11.755666, "from": 148, "to": 155}, {"start": 11.